  "title": "EU Faces Tighter Regulations on ChatGPT, Reddit, and Roblox",
  "summary": "The European Union has introduced stricter rules on ChatGPT, Reddit, and Roblox, requiring platforms to comply with new online safety regulations aimed at protecting users from harmful content and minors. These measures follow a broader regulatory framework that includes the Digital Services Act.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The EU will hold ChatGPT accountable for mitigating risks related to minors, user mental health, and illegal content spread.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Platforms such as ChatGPT, Reddit, and Roblox face additional obligations under the EU's Digital Services Act.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
